<p>Jab yaad sakina ko teri aati hai baba<br />
Sar zinda'n ki deewaaro'n se takraati hai baba</p>

<p>Darbaare yazeedi me bhala kaise mai jaau'n<br />
Hai chaak garebaan haya aati hai baba</p>

<p>Kaano se tapakta hai lahu shaano'n pa mere<br />
zaalim ki aziyat mujhe tadpaati hai baba</p>

<p>Mar jaaungi pyaasi na kabhi maangungi paani<br />
Asghar ki mujhe pyaas jo yaaad aati hai baba</p>

<p>Jab tak tere seene pe na so jaaye sakina<br />
Zindaa'n me use neend kaha'n aati hai baba</p>

<p>Jalte hue qaimo'n ke nazaare hai nazar me <br />
ye baat qayaalo'n se kaha'n jaati hai baba</p>

<p>Hai koun mere paas jiyu'n kiske sahaare<br />
tanhaai meri mout bani jaati hai baba</p>

<p>Yaad aate hai jab shimre sitamgar ke mazaalim<br />
Ye nanhi si dukhtar teri ghabraati hai baba<br />
</p>